[{"title":"题章诩静观堂","author":"李达可","text":"君不见通都荡荡开九逵，肩摩毂击人争驰。\n危楼百尺独高卧，下看胶扰无休时。\n又不见沧江茫茫与天远，轻舟出没风涛险。\n此时著身平地人，遥怜棹夫惊破胆。\n静中有味知者希，红尘拔脚与世违。\n世人颠倒堕醉梦，我独坐照全天机。\n荣名弗羡计非拙，浮利勿争痴更绝。\n骋巧不若拙有馀，役智何如痴且愚。\n高堂悬镜收赴影，对此令人发深省。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60172,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"菩萨蛮 腊梅","author":"李邦献","text":"薰沈刻蜡工夫巧。\n蜜脾锁碎金钟小。\n别是一般香。\n解教人断肠。\n冰霜相与瘦。\n清在江梅右。\n念我忍寒来。\n怜君特地开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60173,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送陈瞻知永州","author":"李防","text":"昔年同醉杏园春，别后花枝几度新。\n彼此宦游疏翰墨，等闲交面起丝纶。\n荣亲未必须莱子，昼锦何尝只买臣。\n布政莫为三载计，清朝台阁整搜人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60174,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"碇斋","author":"李伯玉","text":"先生平地起风波，毕竟中流定得么。\n放取断头船子去，醉眠烟雨一渔蓑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60175,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"吏隐堂","author":"李伯玉","text":"吏隐先寻一著高，尽输酒圣与诗豪。\n君方无事同犀首，我纵有官如马曹。\n把似啜茶看孟子，何如痛饮读离骚。\n胸中磊落浇三椀，倩得麻姑痒处搔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60176,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"怀汤尚书伯纪","author":"李伯玉","text":"一曲清歌一弄琴，十千美酒十分斟。\n江流不动潮初上，斗柄将垂夜向深。\n沙觜露漙孤鹤警，潭心月冷老龙吟。\n此时最是怀乡国，云里征鸿閒远砧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60177,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽徐衡","author":"李伯玉","text":"胸次恢恢百万兵，文才武略冠群英。\n挽弓破筈状元锐，擒寇功封使者荣。\n两尚皇姬升帝眷，一颁皂纛出神京。\n追思八字君恩重，銮驾虽无如朕行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60178,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送萧晋卿西行","author":"李伯玉","text":"上马能击贼，下马能草檄。\n萧郎负此文武之全才，当卧元龙楼百尺。\n屏山阅尽眼中人，磊落深沉只识君。\n冷官不受人料理，拄笏时看西山云。\n与君尝谈秘书阁，百二秦城锦相错。\n第恐羌儿或弄兵，今日始知先一著。\n自有龙图十万兵，请乘一障终权轻。\n初闻召至青油幕，袖中已草从军行。\n相国谋深古来少，想见智囊谈未了。\n贺兰鼠子不足平，底用西征出师表。\n凉州久苦寒烟埋，今年定见玉关开。\n凯旋只在春风后，趁取闲闲登吹台。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60179,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"淳祐七年丁未十一月朔蔡久轩自江东提刑归抵家时三馆诸公以风霜随气节河汉下文章分韵赋诗送别得下字","author":"李伯玉","text":"清时屏臣奸，琴瑟大更化。\n四佞斥昕朝，一札颁丙夜。\n明庭集孔鸾，清庙荐琼斝。\n堂堂西山孙，藉藉少室价。\n给札承明庐，紬书群玉舍。\n功名渠自来，迫逐不容赦。\n君心政事本，治化朝廷下。\n纪纲始宫闱，国本关宗社。\n累章沥忠赤，万口齐脍炙。\n迩来忠佞杂，异论淆王霸。\n昊天且不容，膴仕骈姻娅。\n回遹何日沮，好官从唾骂。\n人方酣势利，君独辩奸诈。\n同僚俱愧赧，灶婢亦惊讶。\n官职一涕唾，名声穷泰华。\n列之绍符间，允矣陈邹亚。\n江东天一方，使者星言驾。\n我亦滕氓廛，何幸寇君借。\n国步正艰危，人心实凭藉。\n良民困盗贼，螟蟊损禾稼。\n豪姓侵细民，荆榛害桑柘。\n污官混廉吏，鲍秽薰兰麝。\n少烦六辔濡，行见四辈迓。\n君诚梁栋材，好与支大厦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60180,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽胡季昭二首 其二","author":"李伯圭","text":"圣朝宽诏下龙墀，尽放累臣脱串羁。\n痛失长沙贾谊舍，空存潮海退之祠。\n孤忠元自轻生死，白骨宁知问去归。\n万里江山丹旐返，悲风一掬泪沾衣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60181,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽胡季昭二首 其一","author":"李伯圭","text":"危言不畏触干戈，瘴雨蛮烟换玉珂。\n今古庐陵两胡老，是非儋耳一东坡。\n拳拳抗志甘三已，恻恻招魂听九歌。\n信得平生稽古力，初心不为履朝靴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60182,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送胡季昭谪象州","author":"李伯圭","text":"伏马总为刍豆谋，孤忠嫠纬不胜忧。\n事当言路官无小，理未安时心肯休。\n千古纲常增砥柱，一身去就等虚舟。\n恶鸱尽任陵鸾凤，赢得清名雪外州。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60183,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"朝中措","author":"李伯虎","text":"史君清德比清湘。\n妙政古相望。\n闲暇恩波万井，笑谈风月千章。\n殷勤劝驾，几人怀德，刻意腾骧。\n试问匣中长剑，也应增焕光芒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60184,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"李伯祥","text":"夜过修竹院，醉打老僧门。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60185,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闻象山论学语有得","author":"李伯敏","text":"纷纷枝叶漫推寻，到底根株只在心。\n莫笑无弦陶靖节，个中三叹有遗音。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60186,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其五","author":"李兑","text":"日抹平山红。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60187,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题梅山云悦楼","author":"李君式","text":"无心出岫道人闲，身在虚无缥渺閒。\n可惜云霓人在望，捲将云雨入梅山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60188,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"沁园春 刘山春新居","author":"李君行","text":"三岛十洲，移掇者谁，玉城稚仙。\n解运诗之巧，裁山剪水，用诗之力，斡地回天。\n大笑宋初，秀才屋子，著不得官家十万钱。\n又谁说，李膺豪放，门号龙门。\n我家呼喝山川。\n道今日山春莺已迁。\n汝南山顶上，虎毋久卧，秀溪底下，龙莫长眠。\n打起精神，护持诗府，推出诗城障山边。\n山川道，如稚仙肯出，当拜君言。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60189,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠汪水云","author":"李吟山","text":"青云贵戚玉麟儿，曾逐銮车入紫闱。\n王母窗前窥面日，太真膝上画眉时。\n沧溟水阔龙何在，华表秋深鹤未归。\n三尺焦桐千古意，黄金谁与铸钟期。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60190,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"出典宣城三首 其三","author":"李含章","text":"分符惭寡术，荣抃出京畿。\n况值新秋节，重经旧钓矶。\n江村初雨歇，水国淡烟微。\n一路风光好，还同衣锦归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60191,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"出典宣城三首 其二","author":"李含章","text":"芦花未白蓼初红，绿水澄蓝是处通。\n景色不须今日别，烟光仍与昔时同。\n马嘶晓月思闲厩，帆挂秋光足便风。\n寄语路人休借问，锦衣归去一衰翁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60192,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"出典宣城三首 其一","author":"李含章","text":"戛云秋翼健磨天，九万修程孰可肩。\n五马幸归乡国路，百城初认钓鱼船。\n馀霞绮阁方池上，宿霭人家叠嶂前。\n多感圣君垂异宠，力思报效向衰年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60193,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"河北行","author":"李含章","text":"为儒还解著征衣，远戍沙连白草齐。\n雁阵不冲羌笛怨，狼烟微认塞云低。\n荞花露湿堆空堑，蓼水泓澄截古堤。\n渐近界河分内外，野禽嘐戛路东西。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60194,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"相国寺晚钟","author":"李含章","text":"高韵出重城，林梢鹤梦清。\n九衢方月晓，四野复霜晴。\n会有神仙听，能无魍魉惊。\n寒山深洞口，依约片云横。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60195,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄内翰王同年","author":"李含章","text":"回翔青琐已多时，四海归荣更是谁。\n通籍禁中参凤阁，司言天上焕龙墀。\n修文礼乐源何大，振笔云雷泽益滋。\n若把王褒颂勋业，未如际会遇昌期。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60196,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄题元长老林亭","author":"李含章","text":"闻说幽亭气象宽，何须基构入云端。\n平瞻一郡连山翠，远瞩千门枕水寒。\n风拂石床松子坠，雨笼莎径栗花乾。\n遥知出定牵吟夜，只欠清猿啸碧湍。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60197,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"渔家","author":"李含章","text":"数家茅屋枕鱼矶，岁岁生涯在渺瀰。\n鸡犬怪人奔竹径，儿孙逢客倚柴篱。\n壁悬蓑笠残烟雨，门对溪山阅盛衰。\n一曲新歌一船月，夜深来往碧涟漪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60198,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"僧家","author":"李含章","text":"不愁白日斜，唯只是僧家。\n远径接芳草，閒庭掩落花。\n木栏栖翡翠，盆水种蒹葭。\n到此常留意，深窗自煮茶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60199,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题庐山上化成寺","author":"李含章","text":"楼台高耸入中天，压破寒山数亩烟。\n永日松栏幽鸟语，半空岩石老僧禅。\n窗临樛木排深涧，檐拂长萝下翠颠。\n野客每来何所得，一声秋磬似相便。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60200,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题武陵护戎林亭","author":"李含章","text":"修篁簇径出林椒，可与游人避俗嚣。\n曲槛隔花安笔砚，小窗延月伴箪瓢。\n红藤引蔓移山豆，绿叶分葩植水蕉。\n到此每怜清气别，可堪寒夜雨潇潇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60201,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"石盆寺","author":"李含章","text":"巨石何年琢，为盆势莫裁。\n圆疑通泽国，深可并天台。\n法水长时满，青莲向日开。\n无人知此喻，寂寞首空回。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60202,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游桃源观","author":"李含章","text":"碧草芊绵十洞春，青苍寒叠五溪云。\n山萦乳窦层层秀，路隔桃花处处分。\n苔径竹深迷鹤迹，石坛松古漏星文。\n通宵回想尘寰事，好结茅茨向水滨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60203,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"冲寂观","author":"李坚","text":"玉兔朝天去不回，空馀露井荐晨杯。\n屋铃不语湖如掌，无复凌空逸士来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60204,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"余皮","author":"李坚","text":"小试屠龙技已成，遗踪千载詟英灵。\n舳舻不骇风波恶，烟雨时闻草木腥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60205,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"离群村","author":"李坚","text":"好风吹句落烟村，便作棠阴记使君。\n渠有平生绝尘想，群居那得似离群。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60206,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"通真观","author":"李坚","text":"璇璿非复旧宫坛，独向徐碑识二难。\n井底丹灵勿轻汲，昔年曾寿两苍官。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60207,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"李坚","text":"勿讶韦郎誇酷似，情知苏子赋归来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60208,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"李孚","text":"宫柳不知兴废事，春来还是绿纤纤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60209,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春日有感","author":"李孝先","text":"雨敛轻寒淑气回，晓街清霁断浮埃。\n风高柳倦终朝舞，岁闰花迟数日开。\n归梦每逾千里去，远书新过万山来。\n旅情宦况都无赖，强对韶辉殢酒杯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60210,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"登江渎水心亭","author":"李孝先","text":"晚兴清无比，幽亭积水中。\n芰荷千柄雨，松竹四轩风。\n斗鸭飞翎健，潜鱼静思冲。\n飞潜乃常事，何足较穷通。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60211,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题馀干县干越亭","author":"李孝先","text":"吴越犹干地要冲，树亭危岸势凭空。\n春潭倒影黄昏月，古木喧声白昼风。\n鸥鹭惯来窥宴席，烟云无著护帘栊。\n凄凉故国多迁变，独有溪山在望中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60212,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"登江楼","author":"李宏","text":"三江会合水交流，拥抱岚光送客舟。\n只与寄诗身不到，老人可是负江楼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60213,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"庆清朝 木芙蓉","author":"李宏模","text":"碧玉云深，彤绡雾薄，芳丛乱迷秋渚。\n重城傍水，中有吹箫俦侣。\n应是琼楼夜冷，月明谁伴乘鸾女。\n仙游处。\n翠帟障尘，红绮随步。\n别岸玉容伫倚，爱浅抹蜂黄，淡笼纨素。\n娇羞未语，脉脉悲烟泣露。\n彩扇何人，妙笔丹青，招得花魂住。\n歌声暮。\n梦入锦江，香里归路。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60214,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"李寿朋","text":"十日醉如何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60215,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九日","author":"李希周","text":"醺醺终日醉酕醄，一阵西风解浊醪。\n归去来辞吟未足，倚门还仰二山高。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60216,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"李应春","text":"象绘耆英希五老，鹤归华表认千年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60217,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游济渎","author":"李志全","text":"水底微茫见贝宫，灵源直与海相通。\n雪晴人立冰壶外，春暖鱼游玉鉴中。\n鹤反松林巢夜月，神归蓬岛驾天风。\n裴公亭上行吟处，佗日重来兴未穷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60218,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"一线泉","author":"李志甫","text":"蓬莱顶上几相逢，常恨山高目力穷。\n此地纡回泉一线，蓬莱却在有无中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60219,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"瑞岩寺灵芝阁","author":"李抚辰","text":"高阁玲珑倚半空，秋来净扫白云踪。\n无人写此天然景，十二阑干十二峰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60220,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春暮","author":"李时","text":"小园泥滑又妨行，破晓东风始放晴。\n九十日春将解印，两三杯酒自寻盟。\n花依好竹如年少，人对青山俱老成。\n俗客不来清意足，一吟聊复畅幽情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60221,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"六朝旧迹","author":"李时可","text":"六朝更代几兴亡，满地黄花只旧香。\n水鸟不知人事改，双飞犹自恋寒塘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60222,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"舟中夜闻读书","author":"李时可","text":"临溪一舍竹疏疏，舟过时闻夜读书。\n姓字是谁何必问，定应不是俗人居。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60223,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杜鹃花","author":"李时可","text":"杜鹃踯躅正开时，自是山家一段奇。\n莫据眼前看易厌，帝城只卖担头枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60224,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题方漕水阁","author":"李时可","text":"三间水阁傍溪湄，曾倚栏干此赋诗。\n山色溪光还似旧，惜无诗思似当时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60225,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"别余司法","author":"李时可","text":"欲别愁如结，来时眉便开。\n相逢两无事，且尽十分杯。\n明月今宵共，春风几日回。\n梅花发墙角，此际望君来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60226,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"野寺","author":"李时可","text":"野寺不逢僧，修廊且缓行。\n竹藏双鹤睡，风助一蝉鸣。\n坐石侵衣冷，临风漱玉清。\n咏归无限意，新月带星横。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60227,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雪行","author":"李时可","text":"天寒鸦欲栖，客路尚迟迟。\n泥滑蹇驴涩，风斜破帽攲。\n云藏山断绝，梅苦雪禁持。\n客里愁无著，愁边却有诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60228,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游洞霄","author":"李时英","text":"撇开尘鞅作清游，路转溪回景物幽。\n楼阁插天藏九锁，林崖飞瀑看双流。\n声锵玉佩三更月，冷浸冰壶一段秋。\n从此濯缨趋□□，□□□□□□□。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60229,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"大涤洞天留题","author":"李旸夫","text":"谁挽天河泻翠崖，一条飞瀑界烟霞。\n只愁风力半天劲，吹向人间作雪花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60230,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题六和塔","author":"李沆","text":"经从塔下几春秋，每恨无因到上头。\n今日始知高处险，不如归卧旧林丘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60231,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"伏睹禁林新成盛事辄思歌咏不避荒芜上李学士","author":"李沆","text":"禁庭多士列华簪，严乐辉光冠古今。\n御笔腾骧题玉署，宸章照耀咏辞林。\n虚堂挂后传千载，翠琰刊成直万金。\n振复文明知圣作，尊崇儒术见天心。\n增修一院烟霞丽，曲宴群英雨露深。\n自我昌朝为盛事，鳌山清峻重难寻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60232,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"病牛","author":"李纲","text":"耕犁千亩实千箱，力尽筋疲谁复伤。\n但愿众生皆得饱，不辞羸病卧残阳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60233,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"望庐山","author":"李纲","text":"多年不省庐山面，江上初从望中见。\n秀骨苍颜五老人，顾我欣然如素善。\n香炉峰顶紫烟浮，瀑布遥看银汉流。\n云舒霞卷互明灭，倏忽变态无停留。\n却疑清梦寻丘壑，风物何为宛如昨。\n纵令真是梦中看，梦未觉时良不恶。\n平生所愿今乃偿，宽著日月游山房。\n青鞋布袜久已办，百钱挂杖聊徜徉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60234,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"一剪梅","author":"李纲","text":"数点梅花玉雪娇。\n烟水篱边，半袅青梢。\n横斜疏影月黄昏，谁使天香，暗淡飘飘。\n半醉佳人酒未消。\n宝髻偏时，插更斜袅。\n尊前还唱早梅词，琼醑何如，□□□□。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60235,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"丑奴儿/采桑子 其二","author":"李纲","text":"枝头万点妆金蕊，十里清香。\n十里清香。\n解引幽人雅思长。\n玉壶贮水花难老，净几明窗。\n净几明窗。\n褪下残英蔌蔌黄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60236,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"丑奴儿/采桑子 其一 木犀","author":"李纲","text":"幽芳不为春光发，直待秋风。\n直待秋风。\n香比馀花分外浓。\n步摇金翠人如玉，吹动珑璁。\n吹动珑璁。\n恰似瑶台月下逢。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":60237,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}}]